  m_Name: End_Bad
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  NodeId: End_Bad
  LocationName: Laughlin
  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: 'You decide to try surrendering to the raiders. You step out from
    behind your cover with your arms raised. As you do one of the raiders take a
    shot. You immediately feel pain as shrapnel rips through you, causing you to
    fall to the ground in pain. You grab at your body, trying to see how bad the
    damage is, only to see your hands covered in your own blood. As you feel your
    senses and strength leaving you, knowing the end is comming, you only wish that
    you could''ve done something different to change your fate and complete your
    quest. Then you take your final breath and die. '
